<TITLE>Ignition System General</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>TDI (TOYOTA Direct Ignition System) has been adopted to improve ignition timing accuracy and make ignition timing completely adjustment-free.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>ESA (Electronic Spark Advance) has been adopted. The engine control computer controls the ignition timing according to the engine condition based on the signals from each sensor.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Knock control using knock sensors and ECT shift torque control, which reduces shock during A/T shifting, have been adopted for high-precision control.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
